<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>TrackU — Focus made measurable</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Turn your daily effort into visible momentum with a planner, focus timer, analytics, streaks, and a productivity system built for consistency." />
  <meta name="keywords" content="focus tracker, productivity dashboard, study tracker, habit tracking, streaks, analytics" />
  <meta name="author" content="TrackU" />
  <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
  <meta property="og:title" content="TrackU — Focus made measurable" />
  <meta property="og:description" content="Plan your day, track your focus, and build momentum with real data." />
  <meta property="og:image" content="https://tracku.me/images/mnav.png" />
  <link rel="icon" href="/images/icon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.1/font/bootstrap-icons.css" />
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #04080c;
      --bg-2: #09141b;
      --panel: rgba(18, 24, 31, 0.95);
      --panel-soft: rgba(27, 32, 39, 0.9);
      --stroke: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.18);
      --text: #edf6ff;
      --muted: #9aa7b6;
      --muted-2: #738195;
      --green: #30e6b6;
      --green-2: #58f0c5;
      --green-3: #1abf98;
      --sky: #8cccff;
      --sky-2: #9ddaf7;
      --blue: #5f8cff;
      --gray: #a1b0c2;
      --shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.32);
      --shadow-strong: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.52);
      --glow: rgba(48, 230, 182, 0.22);
      --radius: 28px;
      --font: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body {
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(48, 230, 182, 0.06), transparent 26%),
        radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(140, 204, 255, 0.07), transparent 28%),
        var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: var(--font);
      line-height: 1.6;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }
    a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
    img { max-width: 100%; display: block; }
    h1, h2, h3, h4 { letter-spacing: -0.05em; line-height: 1.05; }
    .container { width: min(1200px, calc(100% - 36px)); margin: 0 auto; }

    nav {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 50;
      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      background: rgba(4, 8, 12, 0.72);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--stroke);
    }
    .nav-inner {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 18px 22px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 16px;
    }
    .brand {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      font-size: 1.8rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.06em;
    }
    .brand-mark {
      width: 14px;
      height: 14px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--green), var(--sky));
      box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(48, 230, 182, 0.7);
    }
    .brand span { color: var(--green); }
    .nav-actions { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
    .btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 12px 22px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-weight: 700;
      transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
      border: 1px solid transparent;
    }
    .btn:hover { transform: translateY(-1px); }
    .btn-login {
      border-color: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.14);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02);
      color: var(--text);
    }
    .btn-primary {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--green), var(--sky));
      color: #041b18;
      box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(48, 230, 182, 0.22);
    }

    .hero {
      padding: 56px 0 26px;
    }
    .hero-panel {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.08fr 1fr;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 40px;
    }
    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      padding: 8px 14px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(48, 230, 182, 0.08);
      border: 1px solid rgba(48, 230, 182, 0.18);
      color: var(--green-2);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      font-size: 0.76rem;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .hero-copy h1 {
      margin-top: 18px;
      font-size: clamp(3rem, 5vw, 5.2rem);
      font-weight: 800;
    }
    .highlight {
      display: inline-block;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--green), var(--sky));
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      background-clip: text;
      color: transparent;
    }
    .hero-copy p {
      margin-top: 18px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: clamp(1.04rem, 1.4vw, 1.2rem);
      max-width: 620px;
    }
    .cta-row {
      margin-top: 28px;
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 14px;
    }
    .hero-stats {
      margin-top: 30px;
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 18px;
    }
    .stat-pill {
      min-width: 150px;
      padding: 16px 18px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      border: 1px solid var(--stroke);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02);
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.01);
    }
    .stat-pill strong {
      display: block;
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      color: var(--text);
      margin-bottom: 2px;
    }
    .stat-pill span {
      font-size: 0.76rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .hero-visual-wrap {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .screen-card {
      position: relative;
      width: min(600px, 100%);
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 30px;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(13, 20, 26, 0.96), rgba(7, 10, 14, 0.98));
      border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.18);
      box-shadow: 0 28px 70px rgba(0,0,0,0.45);
    }
    .screen-card img {
      border-radius: 22px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.12);
      background: #0b1218;
    }
    .floating-pill {
      position: absolute;
      right: -18px;
      bottom: 28px;
      padding: 14px 18px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      background: rgba(12, 18, 23, 0.96);
      border: 1px solid rgba(48, 230, 182, 0.24);
      box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
      min-width: 180px;
    }
    .floating-pill strong {
      display: block;
      color: var(--green-2);
      font-size: 1.6rem;
      line-height: 1.1;
    }
    .floating-pill span {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    section { padding: 78px 0; }
    .section-head {
      margin-bottom: 26px;
    }
    .section-label {
      color: var(--green-2);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      font-size: 0.76rem;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .section-head h2 {
      margin-top: 12px;
      font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 3.2vw, 3.5rem);
      font-weight: 800;
    }
    .section-head p {
      color: var(--muted);
      max-width: 760px;
      margin-top: 10px;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
    }

    .feature-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
    }
    .feature-card {
      padding: 24px 22px 20px;
      border-radius: 24px;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(15, 22, 29, 0.96), rgba(10, 14, 18, 0.98));
      border: 1px solid var(--stroke);
      box-shadow: 0 14px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.18);
    }
    .feature-card .icon {
      width: 54px;
      height: 54px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      border-radius: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      color: var(--green-2);
      border: 1px solid rgba(48, 230, 182, 0.18);
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(48, 230, 182, 0.14), rgba(140, 204, 255, 0.08));
    }
    .feature-card h3 {
      font-size: 1.6rem;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .feature-card p {
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }
    .feature-card ul {
      list-style: none;
      display: grid;
      gap: 10px;
    }
    .feature-card li {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      color: #e7eef6;
      font-size: 0.93rem;
    }
    .feature-card li::before {
      content: "";
      width: 7px;
      height: 7px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--green), var(--sky));
      box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(48, 230, 182, 0.5);
    }

    .showcase-layout {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 0.95fr;
      gap: 26px;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .showcase-card {
      padding: 26px 24px;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(11, 18, 23, 0.96), rgba(7, 11, 14, 0.98));
      border: 1px solid var(--stroke);
      border-radius: 26px;
    }
    .showcase-card h3 {
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 3vw, 2.8rem);
      margin: 12px 0 12px;
    }
    .showcase-card p {
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-bottom: 22px;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
    }
    .check-list {
      list-style: none;
      display: grid;
      gap: 12px;
    }
    .check-list li {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      color: #e3edf7;
    }
    .check-list i {
      color: var(--green-2);
      font-size: 1.04rem;
    }
    .showcase-image {
      padding: 18px;
      border: 1px solid var(--stroke);
      border-radius: 26px;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(12, 20, 26, 0.96), rgba(8, 13, 17, 0.98));
    }
    .showcase-image img {
      border-radius: 18px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.12);
    }

    .metrics-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 18px;
      margin-top: 14px;
    }
    .metric-box {
      padding: 24px 18px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      border: 1px solid var(--stroke);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02);
    }
    .metric-box strong {
      display: block;
      color: var(--text);
      font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 2vw, 2.3rem);
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .metric-box span {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .cta-block {
      padding: 32px 0 80px;
    }
    .cta-card {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 18px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      padding: clamp(28px, 4vw, 52px);
      border-radius: 28px;
      border: 1px solid var(--stroke);
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(48, 230, 182, 0.08), rgba(140, 204, 255, 0.06), rgba(12, 17, 22, 0.98));
      box-shadow: 0 18px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.18);
    }
    .cta-card h3 {
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 3vw, 3.1rem);
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .cta-card p {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 1.04rem;
    }

    footer {
      padding: 30px 0 60px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--stroke);
      color: var(--muted);
      text-align: center;
    }

    @media (max-width: 980px) {
      .hero-panel, .showcase-layout, .feature-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .metrics-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
      .screen-card { width: min(640px, 100%); }
    }

    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .nav-inner { padding: 16px 18px; }
      .nav-actions .btn { padding: 10px 16px; font-size: 0.85rem; }
      .hero { padding-top: 38px; }
      .cta-row { flex-direction: column; }
      .cta-row .btn { width: 100%; }
      .hero-stats { gap: 12px; }
      .metrics-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .floating-pill { position: static; margin-top: 16px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('partials/loader') %>

  <nav>
    <div class="nav-inner">
      <div class="brand"><span class="brand-mark"></span> Track<span>U</span></div>
      <div class="nav-actions">
        <a href="/login" class="btn btn-login">Login</a>
        <a href="/signup" class="btn btn-primary">Get Started</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="container hero-panel">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <div class="eyebrow">Focus, planner, analytics</div>
          <h1>Focus is your <span class="highlight">edge</span>.</h1>
          <p>Build consistent study and work habits with live planning, deep-focus tracking, and clear progress data that helps you stay on course every day.</p>

          <div class="cta-row">
            <a href="/signup" class="btn btn-primary"><i class="bi bi-rocket-takeoff"></i> Start free</a>
            <a href="#features" class="btn btn-login"><i class="bi bi-play-circle"></i> Explore features</a>
          </div>

          <div class="hero-stats">
            <div class="stat-pill">
              <strong>1200+</strong>
              <span>Habit logs</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-pill">
              <strong>365d</strong>
              <span>History view</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-pill">
              <strong>7x</strong>
              <span>Clarity</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-visual-wrap">
          <div class="screen-card">
            <img src="/images/6.png" alt="TrackU dashboard interface" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" />
          </div>
          <div class="floating-pill">
            <strong>+38%</strong>
            <span>Focus this week</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="features">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head">
          <span class="section-label">Everything in one workflow</span>
          <h2>Turn effort into momentum.</h2>
          <p>Track what matters, reduce guesswork, and turn consistency into a system you can keep using every single day.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-grid">
          <article class="feature-card">
            <div class="icon"><i class="bi bi-calendar3"></i></div>
            <h3>Daily planner</h3>
            <p>Keep your priorities visible with task lists, notes, and structured planning that syncs to your day.</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Task flow</li>
              <li>Daily notes</li>
              <li>Quick review</li>
            </ul>
          </article>

          <article class="feature-card">
            <div class="icon"><i class="bi bi-stopwatch"></i></div>
            <h3>Focus timer</h3>
            <p>Hold attention longer with clear, distraction-free time tracking and deep-work rhythm management.</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Session tracking</li>
              <li>Flow state</li>
              <li>Real time output</li>
            </ul>
          </article>

          <article class="feature-card">
            <div class="icon"><i class="bi bi-bar-chart-line"></i></div>
            <h3>Smart analytics</h3>
            <p>See trends, identify your strongest days, and make better decisions with data you can trust.</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Goal insights</li>
              <li>Productivity trends</li>
              <li>Long-view reporting</li>
            </ul>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="container showcase-layout">
        <div class="showcase-card">
          <span class="section-label">Consistency</span>
          <h3>Know exactly where your energy is going.</h3>
          <p>Use the heatmap to monitor your focus journey over time, spot gaps early, and stay in rhythm with your goals.</p>
          <ul class="check-list">
            <li><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill"></i> Daily goal tracking and streak visibility</li>
            <li><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill"></i> Dark contribution calendar for long-term progress</li>
            <li><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill"></i> Better understanding of your premium focus days</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="showcase-image">
          <img src="/images/2.png" alt="Focus heatmap calendar" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head">
          <span class="section-label">Data that motivates</span>
          <h2>Metrics built to help you improve.</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="metrics-grid">
          <div class="metric-box">
            <strong>14.8h</strong>
            <span>Avg Focus / Week</span>
          </div>
          <div class="metric-box">
            <strong>82%</strong>
            <span>Goal Rate</span>
          </div>
          <div class="metric-box">
            <strong>24</strong>
            <span>Sessions</span>
          </div>
          <div class="metric-box">
            <strong>11</strong>
            <span>Active streaks</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="container showcase-layout">
        <div class="showcase-image">
          <img src="/images/6.png" alt="Analytics chart" loading="lazy" />
        </div>

        <div class="showcase-card">
          <span class="section-label">Built for progress</span>
          <h3>Turn raw work into a repeatable workflow.</h3>
          <p>Whether you are studying, building, creating, or learning, the system helps you keep a clear view of your effort and growth.</p>
          <ul class="check-list">
            <li><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill"></i> Clear daily focus tracking</li>
            <li><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill"></i> Achievement-based motivation</li>
            <li><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill"></i> Simple dashboards built for action</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head">
          <span class="section-label">Why people stay</span>
          <h2>More than a tracker — a full focus system.</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-grid">
          <article class="feature-card">
            <div class="icon"><i class="bi bi-fire"></i></div>
            <h3>Streaks</h3>
            <p>Consistency matters more than perfection. Visible streaks keep your efforts moving forward.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="feature-card">
            <div class="icon"><i class="bi bi-trophy"></i></div>
            <h3>Achievements</h3>
            <p>Unlock progress milestones and convert effort into visible wins across the week.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="feature-card">
            <div class="icon"><i class="bi bi-graph-up-arrow"></i></div>
            <h3>Long-term trend</h3>
            <p>Track history, spot your best windows, and improve your routine with harder evidence.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta-block">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="cta-card">
          <div>
            <h3>Focus on the work. Let the system handle the tracking.</h3>
            <p>Build a routine that rewards consistency and helps you improve every day.</p>
          </div>
          <a href="/signup" class="btn btn-primary"><i class="bi bi-rocket-takeoff"></i> Create account</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="container">
      <p>© 2025 TrackU. Built for disciplined, intentional work.</p>
    </div>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
